WEBVTT

00:47.964 --> 00:48.882
Did you see that?

00:48.965 --> 00:51.009
- That's Soo-ho, right?
- What's happening?

00:51.092 --> 00:52.510
- What is he doing?
- What is it?

01:12.655 --> 01:13.490
He's awesome.

01:13.573 --> 01:15.700
- Are you serious?
- Soo-ho just saved…

01:18.495 --> 01:22.415
You're all just staring
and not helping your friend.

01:23.458 --> 01:25.126
Get back into your classrooms.

01:25.210 --> 01:28.004
- Go on!
- Yes, sir.

01:28.087 --> 01:30.965
Do you think that school is a playground?

02:02.539 --> 02:03.915
I need to be quick.

02:08.002 --> 02:09.087
Hey, Soo-ho.

02:12.590 --> 02:15.093
- You sure are proactive lately.
- Did you come back to see me?

02:15.760 --> 02:16.594
What?

02:16.678 --> 02:18.680
Why do you care so much about what I do?

02:18.763 --> 02:21.349
- What the hell?
- You could always ignore me.

02:22.100 --> 02:24.144
Don't go around following my every move.

02:35.155 --> 02:37.198
That was really close.

02:53.506 --> 02:54.841
Thank you.

02:55.967 --> 02:58.887
But why did you help me out?

03:01.055 --> 03:02.390
Hey, you.

03:04.726 --> 03:05.768
Never mind.

03:06.644 --> 03:08.521
- Bring my helmet tomorrow--
- Will do.

03:09.188 --> 03:10.023
Hey!

03:10.607 --> 03:11.691
My helmet…

03:17.780 --> 03:18.990
Hey, Ju-kyung.

03:19.824 --> 03:20.783
Are you all right?

03:24.329 --> 03:25.747
I'm really sorry.

03:25.830 --> 03:27.832
Don't ever pull that kind of prank again.

03:27.916 --> 03:29.542
No worries. I'm really okay.

03:30.126 --> 03:32.211
By the way, Soo-ho totally startled me.

03:32.295 --> 03:34.255
I've never seen him help anyone out.

03:35.298 --> 03:36.216
I'm right, aren't I?

03:36.299 --> 03:39.135
It's probably because
the hall monitor was there.

03:41.930 --> 03:45.850
Anyway, Ju-kyung looks pretty
even after being hit with a cake.

03:47.352 --> 03:48.603
Are you okay, Ju-kyung?

03:48.686 --> 03:50.855
- That must have been a shock.
- The cake hit her.

03:50.939 --> 03:52.065
Come on, Hyun-kyu.

03:52.148 --> 03:54.317
- I told you.
- She's still a goddess.

03:56.027 --> 03:57.237
Let's sit.

04:06.204 --> 04:10.458
Did he perhaps help me
because he knew my true face?

04:22.637 --> 04:23.554
Hey.

04:24.180 --> 04:25.014
What the…

04:25.098 --> 04:26.766
Hey, what's going on?

04:28.685 --> 04:29.644
Here.

04:31.104 --> 04:32.230
So what do you think?

04:32.313 --> 04:35.233
He must have figured it out.
Otherwise, why would he help you?

04:35.316 --> 04:36.734
Right?

04:36.818 --> 04:38.486
When did he figure it out?

04:38.569 --> 04:41.114
He seemed clueless not so long ago.

04:41.197 --> 04:43.074
But why help me out, though?

04:43.783 --> 04:46.369
He's not the type to help someone out.

04:46.452 --> 04:47.829
People call him a sociopath.

04:48.955 --> 04:50.623
To hold it against you.

04:51.624 --> 04:52.625
Why?

04:53.293 --> 04:54.919
It's not my fault I look ugly!

04:55.003 --> 04:56.963
You're a fraud
for pretending to be pretty.

04:58.923 --> 05:02.343
It's not as if I extorted money
or harmed anyone by applying makeup--

05:02.427 --> 05:04.345
You did say you teased him shamelessly.

05:05.013 --> 05:07.432
And the fact that he got conned.

05:07.515 --> 05:09.642
That in itself can be very humiliating.

05:09.726 --> 05:11.144
You're in big trouble now.

05:11.227 --> 05:13.855
I'd rather he just
take it out on me right now.

05:15.064 --> 05:17.817
Maybe he's planning
to take revenge on you.

05:19.068 --> 05:20.069
Revenge?

05:20.153 --> 05:21.279
What? How?

05:21.362 --> 05:23.906
He's going to slowly close in on you

05:23.990 --> 05:26.034
and turn you into a nervous wreck.

05:26.117 --> 05:27.243
And then…

05:28.745 --> 05:32.123
"Revenge is a dish best served cold."

05:32.999 --> 05:34.542
That saying is there for a reason.

05:35.043 --> 05:37.837
Gosh, it's killing me.

05:40.465 --> 05:41.716
I'll be off then.

05:42.300 --> 05:43.134
Bye.

05:46.345 --> 05:48.556
Unbelievable. Are you close with her?

05:48.639 --> 05:50.391
She's a beauty. Can you hook me up?

05:50.475 --> 05:51.893
I want to ask her out.

05:53.478 --> 05:56.064
What? Ask her out? You have a girlfriend.

05:56.147 --> 05:59.067
Now, English is not that hard.

05:59.150 --> 06:01.277
So just trust me and follow my lead, okay?

06:01.360 --> 06:02.320
- Yes.
- Yes.

06:02.403 --> 06:03.571
All right, now.

06:03.654 --> 06:06.282
Singular comes from
the Latin word singularis…

06:06.365 --> 06:08.034
Does he really know?

06:08.117 --> 06:10.453
No, he can't know that for sure.

06:11.329 --> 06:12.538
What if he knows?

06:12.622 --> 06:15.666
Plural comes from the Latin word pluralis.

06:16.542 --> 06:18.377
Which means more than one.

06:18.461 --> 06:19.504
PLURAL, REVENGE, PLURAL…

06:19.587 --> 06:20.713
So…

06:21.881 --> 06:25.676
When we have more than
one person or a thing,

06:25.760 --> 06:28.346
we would use a plural noun.

06:29.347 --> 06:32.308
Maybe he's planning
to take revenge on you.

06:32.391 --> 06:34.519
Okay, Chapter One.

06:34.602 --> 06:35.812
- Chapter One.
- Chapter One.

06:35.895 --> 06:37.730
All right, now.

06:37.814 --> 06:42.318
Grammatical numbers
are frequent themes on tests…

06:42.401 --> 06:43.402
An earthquake?

06:45.113 --> 06:47.365
Although they are not plural forms,

06:47.448 --> 06:51.619
some words that have "s" at the end
are easily mistaken for the plural…

06:51.702 --> 06:55.540
The most important thing
in a science experiment is safety.

06:55.623 --> 06:57.625
Be careful not to hurt yourself or others.

06:57.708 --> 06:59.043
- Yes.
- Yes.

06:59.127 --> 07:02.505
When heating up the tube,
tilt it away from people

07:02.588 --> 07:05.341
so that the liquid
won't splatter onto anyone.

07:05.424 --> 07:06.384
- Yes.
- Yes.

07:06.467 --> 07:09.095
Don't place the tube
right in the middle of the flame.

07:09.178 --> 07:14.225
Heat it up from the side
and sway it lightly.

07:14.308 --> 07:15.435
- Yes.
- Yes.

07:15.518 --> 07:18.980
You have to submit your paper later,
so make sure to make neat notes.

07:19.981 --> 07:22.984
He's going to slowly close in on you

07:23.067 --> 07:25.736
and turn you into a nervous wreck.

07:25.820 --> 07:27.447
And then…

07:29.157 --> 07:30.950
Are you all right? Get her some towels.

07:31.033 --> 07:32.285
- Let's wipe this up.
- Okay.

07:34.412 --> 07:35.288
Hey, Ju-kyung?

07:36.414 --> 07:38.082
- Yes?
- Are you feeling unwell?

07:38.875 --> 07:41.461
I feel fine, thank you.

08:02.440 --> 08:04.817
- I'm so sorry.
- You should be more careful.

08:04.901 --> 08:06.777
- Sorry about that, Soo-ho!
- I'm sorry.

08:53.533 --> 08:55.368
I'm going to…

08:55.451 --> 08:56.661
Take revenge?

09:11.759 --> 09:12.843
What's wrong, Ju-kyung?

09:15.304 --> 09:16.222
Lim Ju-kyung.

09:23.437 --> 09:24.897
I'm going to…

09:26.482 --> 09:28.234
Ju-kyung, what's the matter?

09:30.945 --> 09:33.656
Do you feel guilty or something?
Why do you keep running away from me?

09:34.198 --> 09:35.241
What?

09:35.324 --> 09:37.326
I'm going to lend you this.
The teacher told me to.

09:37.410 --> 09:39.870
I've marked the chapters we covered
before you came here,

09:39.954 --> 09:41.664
so give it back after making copies.

09:46.085 --> 09:47.461
Copies.

10:00.975 --> 10:04.061
PRINCE COMICS

10:04.145 --> 10:06.731
What a long day.

10:24.373 --> 10:25.416
I'm exhausted.

10:30.379 --> 10:31.756
LEE SOO-HO

10:41.432 --> 10:44.226
The number you have reached
is not in service--

10:44.310 --> 10:45.853
Not funny, Lim Ju-bal.

10:47.980 --> 10:50.149
Not funny, I see.

10:50.232 --> 10:51.651
Meet me at the comics shop.

10:53.819 --> 10:55.946
- Why?
- I have something for you.

10:56.030 --> 10:58.449
No. You don't need to.

10:59.033 --> 10:59.992
I didn't say what it was.

11:00.785 --> 11:01.827
I'll wait.

11:02.495 --> 11:04.413
Hello? Soo-ho?

11:06.374 --> 11:08.376
Gosh, what do I do?

11:08.959 --> 11:10.753
Who cares? I didn't tell him to wait.

11:14.590 --> 11:15.591
Wait, no.

11:16.759 --> 11:21.263
I'll make sure he'd never even
dream of my being Lim Ju-kyung.

11:40.825 --> 11:42.618
It's about to go out.

11:45.996 --> 11:48.332
Hey, Ju-bal.
Can you mind the shop for a little bit?

11:49.208 --> 11:52.002
Yes, Ju-bal is here!

11:53.295 --> 11:54.797
I better fix this right away.

12:03.514 --> 12:04.348
Hey.

12:05.182 --> 12:06.267
It's been a while.

12:06.350 --> 12:07.601
I wouldn't say that.

12:11.397 --> 12:12.273
Has it not?

12:12.940 --> 12:14.567
So, why did you want to see me?

12:17.319 --> 12:18.154
Here.

12:19.447 --> 12:20.531
It's best served cold.

12:21.615 --> 12:23.534
- What, revenge?
- Tiramisu.

12:23.617 --> 12:25.077
For Cursed Mask.

12:27.496 --> 12:28.372
Tiramisu.

12:29.415 --> 12:31.208
You shouldn't have.

12:35.087 --> 12:38.591
You must have come right after school.
I've never seen you in uniform.

12:39.258 --> 12:40.092
Really?

12:41.510 --> 12:43.637
Of course. Your uniform's nice.

12:44.638 --> 12:45.848
At my school…

12:47.349 --> 12:49.101
there's someone who reminds me of you.

12:50.644 --> 12:51.479
Really?

12:54.398 --> 12:57.568
I have a very common face.
I actually get that a lot.

12:58.903 --> 13:01.030
You must go to a co-ed school then.

13:01.113 --> 13:02.615
Where do you go?

13:02.698 --> 13:03.616
Saebom High.

13:04.283 --> 13:06.202
I've never heard of it.

13:06.785 --> 13:08.579
It must not be around here.

13:09.413 --> 13:10.706
And where do you go?

13:11.499 --> 13:12.333
Me?

13:14.126 --> 13:14.960
I…

13:15.753 --> 13:19.798
You know Ttangkkeut Village, Haenam,
in Gyeongnam province?

13:20.466 --> 13:23.010
- I go to school there.
- Isn't that in Jeonnam province?

13:24.470 --> 13:25.304
Yes.

13:25.387 --> 13:27.765
Ttangkkeut Village in Jeonnam, I mean…

13:28.724 --> 13:29.725
Haenam.

13:29.808 --> 13:31.519
Haenam in Jeonnam province.

13:33.896 --> 13:36.148
- So you transferred here?
- Transferred?

13:36.232 --> 13:37.483
No, I dropped out.

13:38.317 --> 13:39.860
Soon, I'll leave for Canada.

13:40.402 --> 13:42.363
I'm staying with my grandma for now.

13:43.781 --> 13:45.533
- Where in Canada?
- Where?

13:47.201 --> 13:48.077
The capital.

13:48.953 --> 13:49.870
To the capital.

13:50.704 --> 13:51.830
- Vancouver.
- Ottawa.

13:52.414 --> 13:53.249
Ottawa.

13:55.000 --> 13:55.960
There.

13:59.421 --> 14:01.340
Geography is not my forte.

14:01.423 --> 14:04.677
Anyway, it was nice to meet
a fellow horror comics lover.

14:05.302 --> 14:08.222
It's sad to think
I'll never see you again.

14:08.305 --> 14:10.057
Why do I feel like
we'll see each other again?

14:10.140 --> 14:11.892
You must be sad too.

14:11.976 --> 14:14.562
- Come visit me in Otta after you graduate.
- Ottawa.

14:14.645 --> 14:15.688
Yes, Ottawa.

14:16.981 --> 14:18.023
I said Ottawa.

14:20.818 --> 14:22.486
I better head back.

14:23.195 --> 14:26.115
Thank you for this. Take care. Goodbye.

14:26.198 --> 14:27.157
This is ridiculous.

14:32.997 --> 14:34.081
Lim Ju-kyung.

14:50.556 --> 14:52.224
You're bad at acting.

14:53.976 --> 14:55.144
You're Lim Ju-kyung.

15:01.567 --> 15:03.068
No, I'm Lim Ju-bal.

15:04.278 --> 15:07.239
I called you using a number
I got from school.

15:07.323 --> 15:08.741
Yet you show up.

15:08.824 --> 15:10.159
How will you explain that?

15:12.077 --> 15:14.121
- I can explain.
- Go ahead.

15:15.581 --> 15:16.624
We're cousins.

15:17.666 --> 15:19.710
Mine broke, so I'm using Ju-kyung's phone.

15:19.793 --> 15:22.463
- I'm supposed to believe that?
- What's stopping you?

15:22.546 --> 15:23.756
You have the same voice.

15:24.340 --> 15:25.591
It runs in the family.

15:27.051 --> 15:29.762
- So you're saying I'm wrong?
- One hundred percent.

15:58.123 --> 15:58.958
But…

16:10.928 --> 16:12.137
in my eyes…

16:23.983 --> 16:25.401
you are Lim Ju-kyung.

16:43.544 --> 16:46.130
Lim Ju-kyung,
I know you're here instead of studying.

16:46.213 --> 16:48.007
Lim Ju-kyung!

16:50.801 --> 16:53.178
Yes, I am Lim Ju-kyung.

16:53.262 --> 16:54.263
So what?

16:54.346 --> 16:56.974
Are you going to report me
for pretending to be a goddess?

16:57.057 --> 17:00.144
What are you going to do about it?

17:00.227 --> 17:01.645
What will you do?

17:07.735 --> 17:09.611
That's great, Ju-kyung.

17:09.695 --> 17:12.281
You better head home straight away!

17:27.629 --> 17:28.881
I'm done for.

17:35.345 --> 17:38.348
What's wrong with my life?

17:47.274 --> 17:48.400
I just bought this.

17:50.069 --> 17:52.029
She must have it out for my jackets.

18:27.523 --> 18:28.857
CURSED MASK

18:28.941 --> 18:31.110
Thanks for keeping a secret
about my no-makeup face!

18:33.695 --> 18:35.114
Hey, wait up.

18:35.823 --> 18:38.117
I brought the wrong thing.

18:38.200 --> 18:39.368
Give it back.

18:40.202 --> 18:41.829
There are menstrual pads inside.

18:43.372 --> 18:44.915
I'll bring the right one tomorrow.

18:55.634 --> 18:56.718
Hey, Soo-ho.

18:58.137 --> 18:59.805
Do you know Ju-kyung's number?

19:00.722 --> 19:02.349
I'll take it off in the restroom.

19:05.394 --> 19:07.855
- What was that?
- Isn't being ugly bad enough?

19:10.107 --> 19:13.360
Seriously, what's with my life?

19:26.248 --> 19:27.124
Goodness.

19:29.543 --> 19:30.544
You scared me.

19:30.627 --> 19:34.173
I sent you home to study.
What are you doing here on the floor?

19:34.798 --> 19:35.799
Mom?

19:37.259 --> 19:39.428
Can I please drop out?

19:40.179 --> 19:42.181
Wait, what is this sewer smell?

19:43.473 --> 19:45.642
This place is a dump.

19:50.230 --> 19:52.274
You scared the heck out of me.

19:53.692 --> 19:54.860
What's with you?

19:55.527 --> 19:56.361
Hey, sis.

19:57.362 --> 19:59.364
Can you just step on me and kill me?

19:59.448 --> 20:00.699
Whatever.

20:01.366 --> 20:03.702
Mom, I'm home. What are you doing?

20:03.785 --> 20:06.121
The sewer smell is coming up.

20:06.663 --> 20:07.539
What do we do?

20:07.623 --> 20:09.541
You're right, I smell it too.

20:09.625 --> 20:10.626
What do we do?

20:10.709 --> 20:11.960
Gosh, it's seriously bad.

20:12.586 --> 20:15.923
The sewer smell is
more important than I am.

20:17.674 --> 20:19.468
Of course, it is.

20:22.346 --> 20:24.264
Gosh, what now, Mom?

20:49.539 --> 20:50.624
Ju-kyung?

20:51.166 --> 20:52.960
- Ju-kyung.
- Yes?

20:53.043 --> 20:54.920
Why are you staring off into space?

20:55.003 --> 20:56.838
Go tell your sister that dinner's ready.

20:57.756 --> 20:58.799
Okay.

21:00.008 --> 21:00.842
Really?

21:02.261 --> 21:04.012
What's with her?

21:05.681 --> 21:08.225
What's gotten into her head, not studying?

21:10.102 --> 21:12.479
She's just like her dad
in making me upset.

21:12.562 --> 21:14.231
Honey, you're getting heated again.

21:14.314 --> 21:16.191
Drink some cold water to cool you down.

21:16.275 --> 21:17.359
That's good.

21:17.943 --> 21:19.695
- Nice and cool.
- It's too cold!

21:26.368 --> 21:27.452
Hee-kyung,

21:28.245 --> 21:30.330
Mom says dinner's ready.

21:37.379 --> 21:39.172
Darn it. I said not to dive into it.

21:39.881 --> 21:41.258
That ridiculous idiot.

21:41.967 --> 21:45.679
Don't be afraid. The end of fear is ruin.

21:45.762 --> 21:46.596
Ruin?

21:47.472 --> 21:49.349
You think I'll end the game like this?

21:49.433 --> 21:51.393
Here I go. I'll carry out solo kills.

21:54.229 --> 21:55.814
- Darn it!
- The end of fear

21:55.897 --> 21:58.900
is ruin and only ruin.

22:00.610 --> 22:01.445
Yes,

22:02.154 --> 22:03.947
let's not be afraid.

22:05.866 --> 22:07.993
Feel the power of my blade!

22:27.095 --> 22:30.474
Eat the veggies and raw kimchi first
before they spoil.

22:36.104 --> 22:37.939
You didn't eat what I brought last time.

22:38.023 --> 22:40.275
- I've been eating out.
- Were they not good?

22:40.358 --> 22:41.193
No.

22:41.693 --> 22:43.820
I mean, they were good.

22:44.738 --> 22:47.282
A cleaning lady should stick to cleaning

22:47.365 --> 22:49.868
and not bring those awful things, right?

22:50.494 --> 22:51.369
They tasted great.

22:52.579 --> 22:53.663
I mean it.

22:53.747 --> 22:54.790
Right?

22:54.873 --> 22:57.250
Make sure not to skip your meals
even if you're busy.

23:03.048 --> 23:06.593
MESSAGE

23:06.676 --> 23:09.429
I have something to say.
Let's meet before school.

23:10.847 --> 23:12.474
- I'll get going.
- Wait.

23:13.308 --> 23:16.061
Do you not want me to clean
that room today either?

23:19.439 --> 23:21.108
Yes. I'll do it.

23:21.191 --> 23:22.359
Don't go in there.

23:29.199 --> 23:31.409
Hey, you! What did you do to your eyes?

23:31.493 --> 23:33.078
You look like you got punched.

23:33.161 --> 23:35.539
Sweetheart, that's a makeup trend.

23:36.414 --> 23:37.666
Smoky makeup.

23:37.749 --> 23:39.126
Erase that before you go!

23:39.209 --> 23:40.252
Silence!

23:42.212 --> 23:43.922
Don't stop me now.

23:44.923 --> 23:45.924
I'm on my way…

23:47.175 --> 23:49.136
to end someone.

23:51.096 --> 23:52.681
As if.

23:52.764 --> 23:53.974
You go, girl!

24:07.445 --> 24:08.363
Lee Soo-ho!

24:23.253 --> 24:24.462
The end of fear…

24:25.422 --> 24:26.631
is ruin.

24:40.645 --> 24:42.731
The sword has been drawn.

24:45.942 --> 24:47.694
There's no turning back.

24:54.743 --> 24:56.745
If you say a word about my no-makeup face,

24:57.537 --> 24:58.663
I will…

25:09.633 --> 25:10.675
You will what?

25:15.430 --> 25:16.640
The end of fear…

25:17.599 --> 25:18.725
is ruin?

25:27.776 --> 25:28.777
Well,

25:29.277 --> 25:31.404
I'm not saying I'll do something.

25:32.656 --> 25:35.867
I'm on my knees begging you not to tell.

25:36.534 --> 25:38.536
It might seem small
to a good-looking guy like you,

25:38.620 --> 25:40.622
but it's a matter of life or death for me.

25:40.705 --> 25:42.374
I beg of you.

25:42.457 --> 25:43.375
Seriously?

25:44.042 --> 25:44.876
Must I?

25:45.710 --> 25:46.795
Why?

25:46.878 --> 25:49.965
Why should I do you a favor
when you deceived me with two faces?

25:50.048 --> 25:51.132
Please.

25:52.425 --> 25:55.303
Can you have mercy on me
like the generous man that you are?

25:55.971 --> 25:58.932
I'll do anything you ask
if you keep my secret.

26:01.184 --> 26:02.102
Just get up.

26:03.895 --> 26:04.771
Yes.

26:05.313 --> 26:07.941
He is one of the two towers.
Savior Soo-ho.

26:10.151 --> 26:12.404
Please have mercy on me.

26:17.993 --> 26:19.744
You'll do anything I say?

26:53.236 --> 26:54.362
What's this?

26:56.197 --> 26:57.991
Did you read my mind or something?

26:58.950 --> 27:02.120
How in the world did you bring me here?

27:02.203 --> 27:03.413
Goodness.

27:22.849 --> 27:24.142
Jackpot.

27:36.112 --> 27:37.155
Can I give you a hand?

27:38.323 --> 27:40.992
No, that's okay.
I'm calling my insurance company.

27:41.076 --> 27:43.244
Who has the time for all that?
Aren't you busy?

28:07.727 --> 28:10.021
What are you doing?
Get your spare tire out.

28:11.564 --> 28:12.399
Sure.

28:23.368 --> 28:24.494
Here's the tire.

28:24.577 --> 28:26.413
I'm sorry. One second.

28:32.168 --> 28:33.086
Gosh.

28:33.878 --> 28:35.213
How is he so cute?

28:40.051 --> 28:42.053
- You've never replaced one, have you?
- No.

28:42.637 --> 28:44.889
I actually don't drive often.

28:53.523 --> 28:55.442
How can she do that
with such small wrists?

28:56.276 --> 28:58.611
She's so strong.

29:00.363 --> 29:01.948
- Cute, right?
- Yes.

29:02.031 --> 29:03.533
Where does he go?

29:20.008 --> 29:21.801
Can't have you hurt your precious eyes.

29:22.385 --> 29:23.470
Well, then.

29:30.268 --> 29:32.854
He'll take pity on me
and not spread the word.

29:35.231 --> 29:37.734
Look how merciless he looks.

30:11.601 --> 30:13.394
Please drink this while you work on it.

30:14.103 --> 30:15.021
Thank you.

30:29.744 --> 30:30.662
Here.

30:30.745 --> 30:31.871
Okay.

30:32.622 --> 30:33.873
Do you teach here?

30:33.957 --> 30:37.001
Yes. I teach literature here.

30:37.794 --> 30:39.504
I knew you were in liberal arts.

30:41.965 --> 30:44.175
By the way,
this car was discontinued long ago.

30:44.259 --> 30:45.593
Are you into classic cars?

30:45.677 --> 30:46.761
No.

30:46.845 --> 30:48.346
Well, it's…

30:49.597 --> 30:52.058
the first car my dad bought in 1995.

30:52.809 --> 30:54.435
I have lots of memories with it,

30:54.519 --> 30:56.646
so I couldn't just get rid of it.

30:56.729 --> 30:58.398
I take it out for a spin sometimes.

30:59.107 --> 31:01.568
But all of a sudden, it causes trouble.

31:01.651 --> 31:04.195
But I guess this will also
form a good memory.

31:04.279 --> 31:05.530
I don't like that.

31:06.114 --> 31:07.198
Excuse me?

31:07.282 --> 31:10.702
I rather want it to be a beginning
rather than a memory.

31:10.785 --> 31:12.871
"A beginning rather than a memory."

31:14.831 --> 31:16.124
That has a nice ring to it.

31:18.334 --> 31:19.168
Well…

31:19.252 --> 31:20.837
what kind of beginning?

31:21.421 --> 31:22.547
It's all fixed.

31:24.090 --> 31:27.051
Thank you. How can I repay you?

31:27.135 --> 31:28.553
Why don't you buy me dinner?

31:29.512 --> 31:31.556
- Excuse me?
- Here, type it in.

31:31.639 --> 31:32.515
Your number.

31:35.476 --> 31:36.311
Okay.

31:39.647 --> 31:40.690
Here you go.

31:43.526 --> 31:44.402
Sparks.

31:45.069 --> 31:46.946
If we get another spark,

31:47.572 --> 31:48.740
we'll start dating, okay?

31:50.491 --> 31:51.326
Excuse me?

31:53.703 --> 31:54.829
Hello?

31:54.913 --> 31:57.206
Yes, I see. I'll be right there.

31:57.707 --> 31:58.541
Your name is?

31:59.459 --> 32:00.418
Han Jun-woo.

32:01.044 --> 32:03.087
Then I'll wait for your call, Han Jun-woo.

32:03.838 --> 32:04.714
Bye.

32:08.176 --> 32:10.178
Consider what I said about a beginning.

32:15.934 --> 32:18.061
This feels surreal.

32:24.525 --> 32:25.860
ECONOMIC CHANGES IN THE EARLY JOSEON ERA

32:25.944 --> 32:28.529
The important factors
of early Joseon's economy are

32:28.613 --> 32:31.741
the tax system and the land system.

32:31.824 --> 32:34.118
The tax laws created
under the rule of King Sejong

32:34.202 --> 32:37.246
are the nine-level year law
and the six-level land law.

32:38.373 --> 32:40.500
Firstly, the nine-level year law
is based on

32:40.583 --> 32:43.920
- I'm thirsty.
- how good of a harvest…

32:46.464 --> 32:47.799
What's wrong?

32:49.467 --> 32:52.720
Sir, can I go to the restroom, please?

32:52.804 --> 32:53.721
Sure, go ahead.

32:58.559 --> 33:02.772
In the Joseon era,
ladies couldn't say such things.

33:02.855 --> 33:03.982
It's not an issue today.

33:04.065 --> 33:06.025
Hey, let me go too. I have to pee as well.

33:06.109 --> 33:07.235
I'll see you next class.

33:07.318 --> 33:08.569
- Yes, sir.
- Yes, sir.

33:14.534 --> 33:15.660
Get out of my way.

33:21.582 --> 33:23.251
You must have been so thirsty.

33:23.793 --> 33:25.962
It's your favorite drink. Enjoy.

33:26.921 --> 33:27.922
Have a good one today.

33:36.347 --> 33:37.807
Hold it higher. I can't see.

33:37.890 --> 33:39.642
- Like this? How's it now?
- I can't see.

33:39.726 --> 33:42.103
- No, I can't see.
- Like this? How about now?

33:43.062 --> 33:44.022
Jeez.

33:44.689 --> 33:46.774
- Helmet?
- Sorry, my bad.

33:49.360 --> 33:50.194
Hey,

33:50.820 --> 33:52.113
where's my helmet?

33:53.781 --> 33:54.782
Right, the helmet.

33:56.034 --> 33:58.995
I was so busy and I forgot.

33:59.078 --> 34:00.038
You forgot?

34:01.456 --> 34:02.874
You must be out of your mind.

34:04.208 --> 34:05.376
I'm really sorry.

34:08.171 --> 34:10.339
You think I'm a pushover
because I'm being nice?

34:10.423 --> 34:13.509
A pushover? Of course not.

34:13.593 --> 34:17.055
I'll bring it tomorrow. I mean it.

34:17.138 --> 34:18.806
If you don't bring it tomorrow,

34:19.557 --> 34:20.558
you'll pay for it.

34:21.309 --> 34:22.810
Okay. Got it.

34:32.403 --> 34:34.113
Why are you being so tough on her?

34:34.197 --> 34:36.532
She's obviously trying to get
your attention with that helmet.

34:36.616 --> 34:38.576
She took my helmet to get my attention?

34:38.659 --> 34:39.869
She just got me upset.

34:39.952 --> 34:42.038
Why would the goddess steal
the woodcutter's clothes?

34:42.121 --> 34:44.999
It's because she had her eyes
set on the big picture.

34:45.083 --> 34:47.502
But wasn't it the other way around?

34:48.628 --> 34:49.879
Who the heck…

34:51.506 --> 34:52.340
It's just old me.

34:53.674 --> 34:54.842
Hello, sir.

34:54.926 --> 34:56.302
- Hello.
- Hello.

34:56.385 --> 34:57.929
Button up. Go ahead and button up.

34:58.012 --> 34:59.430
You're at school, not a sauna!

35:01.933 --> 35:02.892
I'm sorry.

35:09.565 --> 35:10.399
I'm sorry!

35:29.502 --> 35:30.878
Mission accomplished.

35:34.632 --> 35:36.008
What was that?

35:36.551 --> 35:38.761
- What are you smiling at?
- What do you mean?

35:38.845 --> 35:41.097
Hey, I heard you snicker just now.

35:41.180 --> 35:44.809
I got goosebumps hearing you laugh
for the first time in a year.

35:44.892 --> 35:46.477
What was it? Tell me.

35:47.895 --> 35:49.480
Come on, what were you watching?

35:50.815 --> 35:52.400
Gosh. Whatever.

35:53.234 --> 35:54.068
Bye.

36:04.036 --> 36:05.079
FATHER

36:06.205 --> 36:09.125
Come home early.
We'll have dinner with Mr. Choi.

36:12.461 --> 36:13.421
I will.

36:19.802 --> 36:21.637
- What was that?
- Are you okay?

36:21.721 --> 36:24.473
Su-jin, wasn't Korean History
super boring?

36:24.557 --> 36:26.184
I seriously slept through it.

36:46.454 --> 36:47.288
Kangsu!

36:49.457 --> 36:50.333
Kangsu!

36:52.251 --> 36:53.377
Are you zoning out?

36:58.549 --> 37:01.510
No. I was just trying to remove
a stain from my hands.

37:05.389 --> 37:06.390
Not here.

37:12.313 --> 37:13.481
Where is it?

37:14.774 --> 37:16.776
How can such a big thing disappear?

37:21.155 --> 37:24.617
Hey, I ironed your skirt.
The pleats are sharp as a knife.

37:24.700 --> 37:25.826
Be careful not to cut yourself.

37:26.786 --> 37:29.872
Dad, do you know
where the helmet in my room went?

37:31.582 --> 37:32.708
That?

37:36.879 --> 37:37.755
Hey, Ju-young!

37:38.839 --> 37:40.758
- You little punk!
- What was that for?

37:40.841 --> 37:42.468
You come here, you dumbass.

37:42.551 --> 37:44.428
- Why did you sell the helmet?
- So what?

37:44.512 --> 37:46.389
You said you got it off the streets.

37:47.932 --> 37:48.766
You come here.

37:49.267 --> 37:51.519
- Who did you sell it to?
- Hey, you two.

37:51.602 --> 37:52.937
I sold it online. Why?

37:54.146 --> 37:55.564
I'm your older sister.

37:55.648 --> 37:56.565
Come here.

37:56.649 --> 37:57.900
You come right here.

37:57.984 --> 37:59.151
Break it off, guys.

37:59.235 --> 38:00.444
- Get it back.
- Stop--

38:00.528 --> 38:02.071
Get it back!

38:02.154 --> 38:03.364
Are you crazy?

38:04.657 --> 38:06.117
Hey, you're pulling all my hair!

38:06.200 --> 38:07.368
Like I care!

38:07.451 --> 38:09.036
Everyone stop!

38:12.456 --> 38:17.753
How dare you little ones fight
in front of your mom and dad?

38:17.837 --> 38:19.922
- Mom, he…
- You started it.

38:20.673 --> 38:21.507
Honey,

38:22.425 --> 38:23.467
bring it out.

38:24.552 --> 38:27.096
- Please.
- Not that.

38:27.179 --> 38:29.056
Come on, hurry up!

38:43.195 --> 38:45.614
- I love you.
- I love you.

38:50.661 --> 38:53.289
- I love you.
- I love you.

38:54.957 --> 38:55.833
I'm home.

38:56.751 --> 38:58.044
I love you.

38:58.711 --> 39:00.004
I love you.

39:00.087 --> 39:01.589
I guess they fought again.

39:02.256 --> 39:04.091
Keep it going. Love each other.

39:05.926 --> 39:08.512
- I love you.
- I love…

39:08.596 --> 39:10.097
You're tickling me. Do it right.

39:10.181 --> 39:11.515
I love you.

39:13.517 --> 39:14.769
Didn't you wash your feet?

39:15.353 --> 39:16.187
I love you.

39:19.648 --> 39:22.985
The helmet belongs to Han Seo-jun,
so bring it back no matter what.

39:23.069 --> 39:24.403
It's Han Seo-jun's?

39:25.654 --> 39:27.031
Why didn't you tell me sooner?

39:28.616 --> 39:29.867
Watch it.

39:31.369 --> 39:32.495
Put it right here.

39:35.122 --> 39:35.998
LEE SOO-HO

39:36.082 --> 39:37.500
Garden of Blood Volume Three.

39:37.583 --> 39:39.585
- Playground in ten minutes.
- In ten minutes?

39:44.632 --> 39:46.092
I love you, my little brother.

39:46.175 --> 39:47.551
We made up. Okay, Mom?

39:47.635 --> 39:49.303
Hey, Lim Ju-kyung!

39:49.387 --> 39:51.472
- That brat!
- Honey!

39:52.890 --> 39:55.393
- Don't tear the pages, got it?
- Got it.

39:56.060 --> 39:56.894
No!

39:56.977 --> 39:58.145
Hey,

39:58.896 --> 40:01.357
can you please let me have this book?

40:33.180 --> 40:34.765
LEE SOO-HO

40:34.849 --> 40:36.225
It's been ten minutes.

40:44.316 --> 40:46.610
Hey, cutie pie…

40:46.694 --> 40:49.447
Who are you calling a cutie pie?
Do you know how old I am?

40:51.490 --> 40:55.077
Hey, cool kid.
Can you please let me have this book?

40:55.161 --> 40:56.495
I'm not sure.

40:58.289 --> 41:00.291
Hey, I got you the ice cream--

41:00.374 --> 41:02.293
I said I'll think about it.

41:02.918 --> 41:04.128
And I'm thinking about it.

41:07.798 --> 41:09.383
This little brat.

41:09.467 --> 41:11.427
Are you getting mad at me?

41:12.970 --> 41:16.390
I was going to let you have it
considering your situation.

41:16.474 --> 41:18.142
But I don't want to anymore.

41:18.225 --> 41:19.894
Hey, please.

41:20.644 --> 41:23.314
What can I do to change your mind?

41:24.064 --> 41:25.524
Make you laugh?

41:25.608 --> 41:26.901
Look at this!

41:26.984 --> 41:28.319
That's not funny.

41:28.402 --> 41:30.404
That's from forever ago.

41:31.197 --> 41:33.282
How about my zombie act?

41:34.241 --> 41:35.159
Watch this.

41:40.372 --> 41:41.832
That's great.

41:42.416 --> 41:43.834
Do it once more!

41:43.918 --> 41:47.922
One more time!

41:50.633 --> 41:51.967
How do you do that?

41:54.053 --> 41:55.304
Got something else?

41:56.931 --> 41:58.057
Do it once more.

41:58.682 --> 41:59.683
Then…

42:00.935 --> 42:02.770
Just once more, okay?

42:09.151 --> 42:09.985
You're late.

42:10.903 --> 42:11.987
I'm sorry.

42:12.071 --> 42:14.823
I got into an argument with a little kid.

42:14.907 --> 42:17.326
Here you go. Bye.

42:17.868 --> 42:18.786
Wait…

42:26.919 --> 42:29.129
- Isn't it great to be back at school?
- So nice.

42:29.213 --> 42:31.090
- Even the air is fresher.
- Stop it.

42:31.173 --> 42:32.883
- This fresh air…
- Come on, stop it.

42:32.967 --> 42:34.802
Seriously, stop it.

42:36.136 --> 42:38.055
Hey, the thing is…

42:39.723 --> 42:43.727
There's no way you could have folded up
my helmet and put it in your pocket.

42:43.811 --> 42:47.356
I couldn't bring myself to say it.

42:49.608 --> 42:50.568
Here.

42:50.651 --> 42:52.194
Read this after I leave.

42:53.112 --> 42:54.488
What is this?

42:54.572 --> 42:56.448
A love letter!

42:56.532 --> 42:58.158
You're still so popular!

42:58.242 --> 43:00.536
- Still popular!
- Still popular!

43:02.705 --> 43:04.081
- What did she say?
- Don't look.

43:04.164 --> 43:05.416
- Why not?
- Hey, don't look.

43:05.499 --> 43:06.917
There's an old saying

43:07.001 --> 43:09.920
that patience is a virtue.

43:10.004 --> 43:12.673
Please read my letter
with this saying in mind.

43:12.756 --> 43:16.510
Turns out, my little brother
sold your helmet online.

43:16.594 --> 43:17.803
I'm really sorry.

43:17.886 --> 43:19.847
I'll bring it back to you within a week.

43:19.930 --> 43:24.935
So please be patient with me
and be virtuous.

43:25.019 --> 43:26.437
PS. Please don't hurt me!

43:27.313 --> 43:28.480
Hey, what did she say?

43:28.564 --> 43:31.734
- I want to see a real love letter.
- What's there to see? It's obvious.

43:31.817 --> 43:32.693
Come on!

43:32.776 --> 43:34.862
I've never received one in my life.

43:34.945 --> 43:35.821
Just once. Please?

43:35.904 --> 43:36.739
Stop it!

43:37.281 --> 43:39.533
- Whatever.
- Show me what a love letter looks like!

43:39.617 --> 43:40.951
Show me!

43:41.035 --> 43:42.077
Come on.

43:42.161 --> 43:47.374
- Read it to us!
- Read it to us!

43:57.718 --> 43:59.303
Another day begins.

44:08.937 --> 44:10.314
Hey, over here.

44:10.397 --> 44:11.565
It's spicy pork.

44:12.524 --> 44:14.360
It's on the menu whenever I'm on a diet.

44:14.443 --> 44:16.320
No, it's about the same.

44:16.403 --> 44:17.988
Earphones from the classroom.

44:25.871 --> 44:27.748
ARE YOU LEAVING ME ON READ?

44:29.375 --> 44:30.417
BUT IT'S SPICY PORK

44:35.422 --> 44:37.341
Where are you going, Ju-kyung?

44:38.342 --> 44:39.176
What the…

44:44.181 --> 44:46.558
Hey, Ju-young!
Did you get the helmet back?

44:47.101 --> 44:49.395
I'll get it, just wait.

44:49.478 --> 44:52.231
How dare you raise your voice at me?

44:52.314 --> 44:53.732
Have you seriously lost it?

45:02.157 --> 45:04.493
- It came out well.
- I told you so.

45:11.250 --> 45:12.209
Here.

45:13.877 --> 45:14.711
Wait…

45:20.676 --> 45:22.719
We move ahead, going straight

45:22.803 --> 45:24.847
- No lights here, at all
- At all

45:24.930 --> 45:28.517
A dazzling sunshine shining

45:32.354 --> 45:35.107
What's that about?
Why's your boyfriend skipping lunch again?

45:35.190 --> 45:37.443
He's rehearsing for
the talent show audition.

45:37.526 --> 45:40.487
There are so many applicants,
so they're only choosing five teams.

45:41.071 --> 45:43.115
Ju-kyung, how come you look so down?

45:43.198 --> 45:44.241
Did something happen?

45:46.618 --> 45:48.412
No. Nothing at all.

45:48.495 --> 45:49.538
She's just hungry.

45:51.707 --> 45:53.584
Wait, I need to go somewhere.

45:53.667 --> 45:54.668
Gosh, she scared me.

45:54.751 --> 45:56.712
- Limju, what about lunch?
- What was that?

45:58.589 --> 46:00.340
Hasn't she been acting weird lately?

46:04.970 --> 46:08.015
- My helmet.
- I told you I'd get it back in the letter.

46:08.098 --> 46:08.932
What?

46:15.314 --> 46:18.108
I'm really sorry. That came out wrong.

46:18.942 --> 46:21.111
Please be patient
and I'll bring it back to you.

46:21.778 --> 46:22.821
Sorry.

46:26.700 --> 46:27.534
What was that?

46:31.163 --> 46:34.541
Pass it over here. One more.

46:34.625 --> 46:36.460
Hey Seo-jun, are you some kind of thug?

46:38.170 --> 46:40.672
You made the whole class
cower last semester,

46:41.381 --> 46:43.300
and now you're stealing
from a new student?

46:44.176 --> 46:47.638
Acting like some sort of gang leader
by having these idiots follow you around

46:47.721 --> 46:49.640
just makes you look pathetic.

46:50.557 --> 46:53.060
If I see you bullying
other students ever again,

46:53.143 --> 46:55.812
I'll report you to the school
and embarrass you publicly.

46:55.896 --> 46:57.981
Got that, you ridiculous poopheads?

46:58.565 --> 47:01.109
Poopheads? Who are you calling poopheads?

47:01.193 --> 47:02.402
What did she say?

47:02.486 --> 47:04.780
- She called us poopheads.
- Poop what?

47:08.325 --> 47:09.201
She's so cool.

47:19.044 --> 47:20.254
What do you want me to do?

47:20.921 --> 47:21.755
Clean this up?

47:21.838 --> 47:22.965
They're for you to eat.

47:24.675 --> 47:26.843
These are for me? Really?

47:26.927 --> 47:27.761
What's with you?

47:28.428 --> 47:30.514
Food disposal. These are leftovers.

47:31.306 --> 47:32.224
Of course, it is.

47:32.849 --> 47:35.143
For a second,
I thought you were treating me.

47:39.147 --> 47:41.191
- This is good.
- Doubt it.

47:41.275 --> 47:42.317
It's really delicious.

47:42.401 --> 47:44.695
Why would you not eat these
and throw them out?

47:44.778 --> 47:45.696
You must be joking.

47:46.655 --> 47:47.698
So yummy.

47:48.198 --> 47:50.117
I'm going to mix these all together.

47:54.788 --> 47:57.374
- Seriously?
- You have no idea.

47:57.457 --> 47:59.626
It's the best way
to take care of leftovers.

48:04.047 --> 48:06.133
Ta-da!

48:06.216 --> 48:07.551
Help yourself.

48:08.135 --> 48:10.470
- Why? Won't you have any?
- No.

48:10.554 --> 48:12.180
You've never tried this, have you?

48:12.264 --> 48:15.475
Once you try it,
you'll come back for more.

48:15.559 --> 48:17.019
Come on. Try some.

48:17.603 --> 48:18.687
Eat it yourself.

48:24.276 --> 48:26.320
Unbelievable. It's so tasty.

48:26.403 --> 48:27.529
Yum.

48:30.490 --> 48:32.034
Come on, try some.

48:32.117 --> 48:35.162
Even if it's garbage disposal,
I can't eat it all by myself.

48:35.245 --> 48:36.747
Here, go ahead. Try some.

48:54.056 --> 48:54.890
How is it?

48:58.393 --> 49:00.437
- Weird.
- Weird?

49:02.731 --> 49:04.608
It tastes good to me.

49:05.108 --> 49:06.568
It's weird that it's this good.

49:12.699 --> 49:13.742
I mixed it well, huh?

49:14.409 --> 49:15.744
Don't you snort it out today.

49:19.373 --> 49:20.874
Try the glass noodles too.

49:39.309 --> 49:40.602
By the way,

49:41.436 --> 49:42.896
how are you feeling right now?

49:45.232 --> 49:46.983
Good or bad?

49:48.402 --> 49:50.153
- Why do you ask?
- Just because.

49:51.154 --> 49:52.447
Good or bad?

50:00.205 --> 50:01.164
Here's the deal.

50:02.457 --> 50:04.000
Let's call it even with a big one.

50:04.084 --> 50:05.335
What do you mean?

50:05.419 --> 50:08.171
I did say that I'd do anything you asked,

50:08.255 --> 50:10.257
but sending me on little errands

50:10.340 --> 50:12.509
is beneath a smart
and handsome person like you.

50:12.592 --> 50:14.845
You wouldn't want this
to go on forever, right?

50:14.928 --> 50:18.181
You'd have to keep me around,
which would mean a lifelong headache.

50:18.890 --> 50:20.767
So call it even with a big one?

50:21.643 --> 50:22.519
Right.

50:23.437 --> 50:28.442
Something difficult like acquiring
another first print of old horror comics.

50:28.525 --> 50:30.277
Must I? I don't want to.

50:30.360 --> 50:34.698
Come on, think about it. Please?

50:37.868 --> 50:40.704
Okay, let's call it even.

50:41.288 --> 50:42.706
Call it even? Really?

50:43.290 --> 50:45.041
What do you want? What's your mission?

50:55.302 --> 50:57.846
Why are you tapping the table?

50:58.805 --> 51:02.976
TALENT SHOW AUDITION

51:11.651 --> 51:14.362
You trusted me

51:14.988 --> 51:19.910
And you waited for me, my love

51:23.580 --> 51:28.168
Before I tell you I'm sorry

51:28.251 --> 51:29.961
I want to say

51:30.045 --> 51:30.962
- Last night
- Last night

51:31.046 --> 51:32.798
- I started hating you
- I started hating you

51:35.300 --> 51:37.093
- Spinning round and round
- Spinning round and round

51:38.720 --> 51:39.888
Hey.

51:40.722 --> 51:41.932
Next!

51:42.015 --> 51:43.016
- Gang!
- Gang!

51:43.099 --> 51:44.935
Gosh, I'm so nervous…

51:58.865 --> 52:04.496
Seeing him confess to me

52:04.579 --> 52:08.291
I thought of you

52:08.375 --> 52:12.045
And held back my tears

52:12.128 --> 52:15.882
His eyes were waiting

52:15.966 --> 52:17.884
- She's terrible.
- For my answer

52:17.968 --> 52:21.471
I felt so guilty

52:21.555 --> 52:27.769
I couldn't say anything

52:31.523 --> 52:32.774
This won't cut it.

52:34.109 --> 52:35.026
I'm done for.

52:35.110 --> 52:37.112
We move ahead, going straight


52:37.195 --> 52:38.488
- No lights here, at all
- At all

52:38.572 --> 52:40.615
- A dazzling sunshine shining
- Swag

52:40.699 --> 52:42.617
- Dazzling, dazzling, can't breathe, 911
- 911

52:42.701 --> 52:44.953
- What I probably need is Su-ah
- Su-ah

52:53.378 --> 52:54.796
This won't be easy.

52:59.259 --> 53:00.760
Did I drink too much water?

53:01.595 --> 53:03.013
I could make it in time, right?

53:04.514 --> 53:06.600
You guys go ahead.

53:08.226 --> 53:09.644
The next team may come in.

53:11.771 --> 53:13.315
- Let's go.
- I'm so nervous!

53:13.398 --> 53:14.733
- Break a leg!
- Break a leg!

53:15.317 --> 53:16.443
What should we get?

53:19.446 --> 53:20.572
"The end of fear…

53:22.449 --> 53:23.700
is ruin."

53:25.619 --> 53:26.745
I can do it.

53:27.954 --> 53:29.122
Come on!

53:43.470 --> 53:44.554
What's going on?

53:44.638 --> 53:46.431
It can't be over already, can it?

55:30.410 --> 55:31.494
Please pick me.

55:31.995 --> 55:34.581
I'm Lim Ju-kyung from junior class five.

55:34.664 --> 55:36.916
Save me in your hearts!

55:37.000 --> 55:38.251
EDUCATION AND RESEARCH DEPARTMENT

55:38.918 --> 55:39.794
Delete.

55:46.176 --> 55:48.720
Vice Principal,
I said "delete" right away.

55:50.013 --> 55:53.099
I dare say Ju-kyung dances really well.

55:54.893 --> 55:56.061
This is what I'm saying.

55:56.895 --> 55:59.230
The last nationwide exam results
were disappointing.

55:59.981 --> 56:05.153
How many students can we possibly send
to universities in Seoul this year?

56:05.236 --> 56:07.280
Reflect on yourselves!

56:10.533 --> 56:11.868
I'm sorry.

56:12.952 --> 56:13.787
So sorry.

56:13.870 --> 56:14.829
- You.
- Yes, sir.

56:14.913 --> 56:17.582
I asked you to improve
the average grades of the students.

56:17.665 --> 56:20.168
What's going on? Put in more effort!

56:26.007 --> 56:27.425
That was super embarrassing.

57:07.841 --> 57:10.510
I'll be discharged soon.
You didn't have to come.

57:10.593 --> 57:12.929
I wanted to see you
even if it's just for a moment.

57:13.721 --> 57:15.014
How did you feel today?

57:15.098 --> 57:16.516
I felt great.

57:17.183 --> 57:18.393
How's school treating you?

57:18.977 --> 57:20.687
Well, it's the same.

57:21.438 --> 57:24.482
I love seeing my son in uniform.

57:25.066 --> 57:26.901
I have a good physique, that's why.

57:26.985 --> 57:29.362
I'd still look like a model even in rags.

57:30.321 --> 57:34.033
I'm thankful for whoever gave birth to me.

57:34.117 --> 57:35.118
Goodness.

57:36.786 --> 57:38.830
I'll get some sleep now, so head home.

57:39.414 --> 57:40.957
I'll stay and watch you sleep.

57:41.040 --> 57:43.001
I can't fall asleep with you around.

57:43.084 --> 57:45.587
Don't leave Go-un alone late at night.

57:47.213 --> 57:48.214
Got it.

57:48.798 --> 57:49.632
Sleep tight.

57:49.716 --> 57:52.135
You didn't ride your motorcycle here,
did you?

57:52.635 --> 57:55.013
It's dangerous. Please don't do it, okay?

57:55.096 --> 57:56.347
Don't you worry.

58:10.028 --> 58:11.613
That's Lee Ju-hun!

58:11.696 --> 58:12.864
Hey, let's get a picture.

58:12.947 --> 58:14.032
VIP WARD

58:14.115 --> 58:16.409
- Hi, we're big fans.
- Can we take pictures?

58:16.493 --> 58:18.036
Please don't do this here.

58:18.119 --> 58:19.996
- It's okay.
- Thank you!

58:20.497 --> 58:22.165
One, two, three.

58:22.665 --> 58:24.417
- Thanks a lot!
- Thank you.

58:25.335 --> 58:28.796
We are grateful for your donation.

58:28.880 --> 58:30.173
My pleasure.

58:39.182 --> 58:40.308
UNDERSTANDING AROMAS

58:49.275 --> 58:52.320
Understanding Aromas?

58:53.196 --> 58:54.948
- Why are you reading this, Dad?
- Well…

58:55.615 --> 58:59.702
I signed up for a class
on making scented candles.

58:59.786 --> 59:01.871
- You signed up for a class?
- A class?

59:01.955 --> 59:04.374
Where did you get the money?

59:07.252 --> 59:09.128
Did you take some from my wallet?

59:09.212 --> 59:12.590
Honey, the children are listening.

59:13.883 --> 59:15.176
I just borrowed some.

59:15.760 --> 59:17.053
I knew it.

59:17.136 --> 59:19.055
I couldn't account for the missing money.

59:19.138 --> 59:21.891
And what if the kids are listening?
Are you even embarrassed?

59:23.351 --> 59:25.395
Before understanding aromas,

59:25.478 --> 59:28.022
try to understand how I must feel.

59:28.106 --> 59:30.400
That's rich, an unemployed man
enjoying a hobby.

59:30.483 --> 59:31.859
It's not a hobby.

59:32.443 --> 59:34.821
I'm trying things out to make a living.

59:34.904 --> 59:36.573
You could always be a homemaker!

59:36.656 --> 59:40.368
Mom, it's hard just staying at home.

59:40.451 --> 59:42.954
Who knows, he might make it big
with scented candles.

59:43.037 --> 59:44.914
Dad, I'm rooting for you!

59:44.998 --> 59:45.957
Thanks, Hee-kyung.

59:46.040 --> 59:48.960
The more I study,
the more amazed I am by scented candles.

59:49.043 --> 59:52.297
In 5000 BC, in Afghanistan…

59:53.298 --> 59:55.967
- No, wait. It was Pakistan.
- Are you sure?

59:56.050 --> 59:57.302
I am. It was Pakistan.

59:57.385 --> 59:59.679
My goodness.

59:59.762 --> 01:00:02.849
I fell for this face and married him.

01:00:02.932 --> 01:00:06.144
- I was a fool. A fool!
- You are a sucker for looks, Mom.

01:00:06.227 --> 01:00:07.228
What?

01:00:07.312 --> 01:00:08.313
I'm home.

01:00:08.396 --> 01:00:10.982
Hey, welcome home.
You're later than usual.

01:00:11.065 --> 01:00:12.525
Yes, I…

01:00:12.609 --> 01:00:16.863
You went shopping for makeup again, right?
You think I wouldn't know?

01:00:16.946 --> 01:00:18.656
That's not it. I just missed my bus.

01:00:18.740 --> 01:00:22.744
You have makeup caked on your face.

01:00:22.827 --> 01:00:25.413
You'll get to do that plenty
when you go to college.

01:00:25.496 --> 01:00:27.498
What's the rush with the makeup?

01:00:27.582 --> 01:00:31.169
Use that time to memorize
one more English word instead!

01:00:31.252 --> 01:00:32.170
Honey.

01:00:32.253 --> 01:00:35.506
Girls even younger than Ju-kyung
wear makeup these days.

01:00:35.590 --> 01:00:37.383
Girls who don't have good grades!

01:00:37.467 --> 01:00:40.928
When you get older,
all that matters is your grades.

01:00:41.012 --> 01:00:44.432
You don't know what it's like at school.
All that matters is looks.

01:00:44.515 --> 01:00:47.393
What's the point of dolling up

01:00:47.477 --> 01:00:49.729
when your true face is not up to scratch?

01:00:49.812 --> 01:00:53.733
How will you get married
with that face without a decent job?

01:00:53.816 --> 01:00:54.901
Honey.

01:00:54.984 --> 01:00:57.862
- Bombarding her with facts.
- Come on, Mom. You've gone too far.

01:00:59.280 --> 01:01:01.783
They say even the hedgehogs
think their babies are cute.

01:01:01.866 --> 01:01:02.700
Unbelievable.

01:01:02.784 --> 01:01:05.411
You brat, I'm not finished. Come back!

01:01:05.495 --> 01:01:06.704
Calm down, Mom.

01:01:09.207 --> 01:01:10.041
Goodness.

01:01:11.501 --> 01:01:13.294
WARNING
FOR AUTHORIZED PERSONNEL ONLY

01:01:15.254 --> 01:01:16.297
Come in.

01:01:21.052 --> 01:01:22.053
Here.

01:01:24.389 --> 01:01:26.391
I paid an extra 20,000 won to get it back.

01:01:26.474 --> 01:01:27.809
So what?

01:01:28.559 --> 01:01:30.103
I didn't ask you to sell it.

01:01:44.575 --> 01:01:49.247
320 LIKES

01:01:49.330 --> 01:01:51.457
Someone's really popular.

01:01:52.458 --> 01:01:54.293
Her post received 320 likes.

01:01:58.381 --> 01:01:59.924
That startled me.

01:02:01.759 --> 01:02:02.885
I get it.

01:02:04.220 --> 01:02:06.180
I look ugly, even to myself.

01:02:07.181 --> 01:02:09.100
I guess it's the same for Mom.

01:02:11.394 --> 01:02:14.230
- I'm pushing!
- Come on!

01:02:14.313 --> 01:02:16.733
Hey, this is mine.
I'll give you each a bite.

01:02:16.816 --> 01:02:19.110
- You all can give me a bite in return.
- No, thanks.

01:02:21.320 --> 01:02:22.739
GODDESS

01:02:24.949 --> 01:02:27.118
321 LIKES
MY FRIEND IS A TOTAL GODDESS

01:02:39.255 --> 01:02:40.923
LOVE_SSAM2 LIKED YOUR POST

01:02:43.384 --> 01:02:44.677
There's another one.

01:02:45.553 --> 01:02:46.846
Another one who likes you.

01:02:50.516 --> 01:02:55.188
If I post my true face,
you'll all cry, "I hate you."

01:03:01.194 --> 01:03:02.570
LEE SOO-HO:
GARDEN OF BLOOD VOL. FOUR AND FIVE

01:03:02.653 --> 01:03:03.488
PLAYGROUND IN TEN MINUTES

01:03:06.532 --> 01:03:09.118
Can't rest even for a second.

01:03:15.249 --> 01:03:21.255
PRINCE COMICS

01:03:44.111 --> 01:03:45.071
Jeez.

01:03:45.154 --> 01:03:46.697
Hey, are you okay?

01:03:47.448 --> 01:03:50.326
- Watch where you're going.
- I'm sorry.

01:03:50.409 --> 01:03:51.869
Do you know how much this costs?

01:03:51.953 --> 01:03:52.995
I'm sorry.

01:03:53.079 --> 01:03:55.164
You look like a turd…

01:03:55.832 --> 01:03:59.377
Why would you run around in the night
and cause trouble to others?

01:03:59.460 --> 01:04:00.461
I'm sorry.

01:04:00.545 --> 01:04:03.047
Hey, take it easy.

01:04:03.714 --> 01:04:06.551
Look at her face.
Do you think her eyes work?

01:04:07.552 --> 01:04:09.470
I had to bump into some stupid turd.

01:04:09.554 --> 01:04:12.390
Hey, your face is a mess.

01:04:13.432 --> 01:04:15.977
Eyes, nose, and mouth.
None of them are in order.

01:04:16.769 --> 01:04:17.645
Hey, lady.

01:04:18.229 --> 01:04:21.566
Just put your head down and go home.

01:04:22.066 --> 01:04:24.819
- Or at least cover yourself.
- Should I give her my clothes?

01:04:24.902 --> 01:04:26.529
- What nonsense.
- What about mine?

01:04:26.612 --> 01:04:29.156
- Nobody wants to see you naked.
- I mean, seriously.

01:04:29.240 --> 01:04:33.828
- I felt threatened by her face.
- Lady, you're ruining the mood, so go!

01:04:33.911 --> 01:04:35.079
Please go.

01:04:35.162 --> 01:04:37.707
Off you go.

01:04:37.790 --> 01:04:39.333
Dang, that totally killed my vibe.

01:04:43.838 --> 01:04:45.756
She has confidence despite her looks.

01:04:45.840 --> 01:04:47.425
She's the ugliest girl at school.

01:04:47.508 --> 01:04:48.676
Why live?

01:04:48.759 --> 01:04:51.012
If you don't have the looks,
you should at least be sharp-witted.

01:04:51.095 --> 01:04:52.096
Know your place.

01:04:52.179 --> 01:04:55.516
Do you really want to know?
Because you are ugly.

01:05:16.537 --> 01:05:17.997
- You…
- Here.

01:05:19.457 --> 01:05:20.875
Didn't you bring an umbrella?

01:05:21.751 --> 01:05:22.627
Why?

01:05:23.961 --> 01:05:25.421
You want me to get one for you?

01:05:26.839 --> 01:05:28.799
- Okay.
- That's not what I meant.

01:05:28.883 --> 01:05:29.926
What did you mean then?

01:05:30.426 --> 01:05:32.428
You ask me to do stuff for you
all the time.

01:05:33.012 --> 01:05:34.555
Don't you think it's too much?

01:05:34.639 --> 01:05:36.682
I did say that I'd do anything,

01:05:36.766 --> 01:05:39.143
but are you having fun
holding my secret against me?

01:05:40.686 --> 01:05:44.190
How are you any different
from the people who bullied me?

01:05:45.858 --> 01:05:47.860
It's not my fault I'm ugly.

01:05:48.444 --> 01:05:50.780
How come everyone hates me?

01:05:53.324 --> 01:05:55.368
What's the point of putting on makeup?

01:05:55.451 --> 01:05:57.662
I'm still ugly Lim Ju-kyung,

01:05:58.663 --> 01:06:01.582
and I got found out by the likes of you
as soon as I transferred.

01:06:01.666 --> 01:06:04.377
I can't even sleep at night
out of worry you'll reveal everything

01:06:04.460 --> 01:06:06.295
and run errands for you to appease you.

01:06:07.880 --> 01:06:09.548
Do you know how I feel?

01:06:09.632 --> 01:06:12.426
Don't you have a secret
you'd like to hide?

01:06:16.806 --> 01:06:17.848
You…

01:06:18.683 --> 01:06:22.311
You shouldn't make fun of someone's pain.

01:06:53.426 --> 01:06:54.802
Wait here for a sec.

01:07:40.848 --> 01:07:41.682
Ju-kyung!

01:07:42.725 --> 01:07:43.559
Ju-kyung!

01:07:44.435 --> 01:07:45.269
Ju-kyung!

01:07:46.270 --> 01:07:47.188
Ju-kyung!

01:08:10.252 --> 01:08:11.253
I thought you left.

01:08:12.755 --> 01:08:13.714
I just…

01:08:14.340 --> 01:08:15.716
got embarrassed.

01:08:19.470 --> 01:08:21.597
Well, I wasn't thinking straight earlier…

01:08:30.064 --> 01:08:31.440
I'm okay.

01:08:50.751 --> 01:08:54.004
If people find out,
I won't be able to show my face.

01:08:54.088 --> 01:08:55.923
But it's a matter of life or death for me.

01:08:56.006 --> 01:08:57.716
I beg of you.

01:08:57.800 --> 01:09:01.762
You shouldn't make fun of someone's pain.

01:09:17.528 --> 01:09:18.529
Sorry.

01:09:22.533 --> 01:09:23.409
I'm sorry.

01:10:26.972 --> 01:10:28.015
Hey, Lee Soo-ho.

01:10:29.808 --> 01:10:31.518
You got a friend killed.

01:10:32.519 --> 01:10:33.896
Yet you seem to be doing well.

01:11:05.844 --> 01:11:06.845
Excuse me…

01:11:07.513 --> 01:11:08.847
Is this about your helmet?

01:11:08.931 --> 01:11:09.765
Not at all.

01:11:11.308 --> 01:11:12.518
I'm having lunch with you.

01:11:20.067 --> 01:11:21.193
Han Seo-jun!

01:11:32.705 --> 01:11:34.790
Seriously, you punk?

01:12:20.461 --> 01:12:23.005
I'm not sure what happened before,

01:12:23.839 --> 01:12:27.009
but if you feel like talking to someone,
let me know.

01:12:27.092 --> 01:12:28.635
I can be the secret wall you can talk to.

01:12:29.762 --> 01:12:31.347
Do you like Lim Ju-kyung?

01:12:31.430 --> 01:12:34.433
I heard both Lee Soo-ho
and Han Seo-jun like you.

01:12:34.516 --> 01:12:36.727
Who are you going to pick between the two?

01:12:36.810 --> 01:12:37.644
Don't get off track.

01:12:37.728 --> 01:12:38.937
Come over here for a moment.

01:12:39.021 --> 01:12:41.732
I'm being dogged by rumors as is.
Should I just meet him?

01:12:43.108 --> 01:12:44.276
I have something to say.

01:12:45.778 --> 01:12:47.696
I don't think I'm ready yet.

01:12:49.031 --> 01:12:54.036
Subtitle translation by: Sun-young Ahn
